---
title: "Harborbox idle pause against a new command"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: live
    lg1: rest
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  state "At the same time" as all {
    state "Sandbox" as r0 {
      s0: Running
      s1: Pausing
      s2: Pausing, no container
      s3: Paused cold, no container
      s4: Starting, no container
      [*] --> s0
      s0 --> s1: the idle sweep picks the sandbox [unless Command admitted or Command running]
      s1 --> s2: the sandbox is snapshotted and its container removed
      s2 --> s3: the sweep records the pause
      s3 --> s4: the scheduler admits the command [when Command queued]
      s4 --> s0: the command starts
    }
    --
    state "Command" as r1 {
      s5: No command
      s6: Command queued
      s7: Command admitted
      s8: Command running
      s9: Command done
      [*] --> s5
      s5 --> s6: you post a command
      s6 --> s7: the scheduler admits the command [when Paused cold, no container or Running]
      s7 --> s8: the command starts
      s8 --> s9: the command returns
    }
  }
  class s0 teal
  class s1 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s3 blue
  class s4 blue
  class s8 teal
